<header><p class="eyebrow">THE ROAD TO A FINISHED GAME</p><h1>A place worth exploring.<br>A game worth finishing.</h1><p class="lead">The path toward AAA-quality finish is not just more levels. It is a playable benchmark, authored art and animation, dependable controls, expressive encounters, a considered sound mix, and evidence from real players and hardware.</p><p id="plan-purpose"></p></header>
<section class="metrics" aria-label="Plan summary"><div><strong id="total-count">--</strong><span>TRACKED DELIVERABLES</span></div><div><strong id="foundation-count">--</strong><span>IMPLEMENTED FOUNDATIONS</span></div><div><strong id="automated-count">--</strong><span>SCOPED AUTOMATED EVIDENCE</span></div><div><strong id="approved-count">--</strong><span>HUMAN ACCEPTANCE SIGN-OFFS</span></div></section>
<section class="intent"><h2>One excellent slice before a larger campaign.</h2><p>The next content milestone is a polished 15-20 minute Floodgate segment. Progress through the gates below; do not treat a checkbox count as a percentage of AAA quality. Device targets and effort are proposals until the game owner approves them.</p><div id="next-focus"></div></section>
