<section class="notes"><h2>What counts as evidence?</h2><div id="status-definitions"></div><p id="plan-policy"></p><p>Your review checkmarks are stored only in this browser. They do not change GitHub, change delivery status, or certify a feature. Source-controlled status updates require a commit and supporting evidence.</p><p><a id="checklist-source" href="./AAA_CHECKLIST.md">OPEN THE GITHUB-READY CHECKLIST</a> <a id="data-source" href="./production-plan.json">OPEN CANONICAL PLAN DATA</a> <button id="export-review" type="button">EXPORT LOCAL REVIEW NOTES</button></p><div id="references"></div><a href="./roadmap-legacy-v06.html">Archived v0.6 roadmap</a></section><footer>RAINWARD / ORIGINAL SURVIVAL-STEALTH GAME / PRODUCTION TARGET, NOT A CERTIFICATION</footer><div id="controller-menu-hint" hidden>A SELECT / B RETURN / LB-RB GATE</div></main><script type="module" src="./roadmap.mjs"></script></body></html>
